      "date": "2026-11-04 06:00:20.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1: Verified+1\n\nPassed enforced test review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on RHEL 8.10 / x86_64, Rocky 9.8 / aarch64 uploaded by Onyx Autotest from onyx-180vm69: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/f4fb98ab-1e30-4480-beff-0a0c913073a6 ran 5 tests.",
