        "subject": "LU-21096 lfsck: fix wrong label for dryrun in links_remove",
        "message": "LU-21096 lfsck: fix wrong label for dryrun in links_remove\n\nThe LPF_DRYRUN check in lfsck_namespace_links_remove() runs\nbefore the transaction is created and the object is locked,\nbut jumps to the 'unlock' label.\n\nJump to the 'log' label instead.\n\nFixes: 441902fa3d44 (\"LU-17010 lfsck: don't create trans in dryrun mode\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lfsck\nSigned-off-by: Zanhua Huang <zanhua@amazon.com>\nChange-Id: Ia17a042eac1372402880350d8357a59361496f1b\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
